                                "sense_id": "8683cc70-74ae-3408-b5ea-67014640724f",
                                "text": "To arrange and compose pacifically, the differences which may arise between the Federal States; and, should the same not succeed, to point out to the Supreme Chief the measures which should be adopted to re-establish peace and harmony […]"
